  id: npc_ma_sym_info
  text: "To learn your first symbol, you must seek out one of our Academy teachers.
    Each of them can guide you through the process of mastering a basic rune.\nHowever,
    be warned: it is not enough to simply watch. You will need to go through the
    learning process yourself \u2014 practice, focus, and prove that you can draw
    the symbol correctly.\nOnly then will the knowledge truly be yours"
  options:
  - text: "Thank you, I\u2019ll go find a teacher."
